
[{"content":"\rChapter 0：一首关于██的诗\r#\r这是您的自我介绍，一首关于您的诗。告诉大家你是谁吧，让大家了解这个故事背后的人。\n","date":"2026-11-26","externalUrl":null,"permalink":"/plot/chapter0/","section":"活动发布","summary":"","title":"主线 0","type":"plot"},{"content":"\rChapter 1：██的故事\r#\r那个让你成为“你”的故事。\n那个让你来到此地的故事。\n独一无二，只有你能讲述的\n——你的故事，你的独白\nPS：本文与企卡内容面向的主体不同，重点也不同。你不再需要通过从上帝视角概述你的人生来介绍自己（就像简历上的那些数字与字母：GPA、MBTI、过往荣誉与工作经验时长……）专注于你的“故事”吧。人生的导演是上帝与巧合，而故事的导演是你。\n","date":"2026-11-26","externalUrl":null,"permalink":"/plot/chapter1/","section":"活动发布","summary":"","title":"主线 1","type":"plot"},{"content":"\rChapter 1.5：颁奖典礼\r#\r我们正在谱写自己崭新的人生剧本。\n我们也是别人剧本中的演员。\n所有演职人员应当紧密合作，我们聚在一起讨论讨论吧：在奥斯卡颁奖台上，谁负责捧起哪个奖杯。\n非强制打卡活动。无 ddl。文体与字数不限。请自由理解活动内容。可以和他人合作或互相 py。\n","date":"2026-11-28","externalUrl":null,"permalink":"/plot/chapter1.5/","section":"活动发布","summary":"","title":"主线 1.5","type":"plot"},{"content":"","date":"2026-11-28","externalUrl":null,"permalink":"/authors/","section":"Authors","summary":"","title":"Authors","type":"authors"},{"content":"","date":"2026-11-28","externalUrl":null,"permalink":"/categories/","section":"Categories","summary":"","title":"Categories","type":"categories"},{"content":"","date":"2026-11-28","externalUrl":null,"permalink":"/ch1/","section":"Chapter 1","summary":"","title":"Chapter 1","type":"ch1"},{"content":"","date":"2026-11-28","externalUrl":null,"permalink":"/","section":"ICANEATGLASS","summary":"","title":"ICANEATGLASS","type":"page"},{"content":"","date":"2026-11-28","externalUrl":null,"permalink":"/authors/%E7%88%B1%E7%A5%9E%E5%B0%8F%E5%A7%90/","section":"Authors","summary":"","title":"爱神小姐","type":"authors"},{"content":"","date":"2026-11-28","externalUrl":null,"permalink":"/authors/%E6%83%A8%E5%89%A7%E6%96%B0%E9%83%8E/","section":"Authors","summary":"","title":"惨剧新郎","type":"authors"},{"content":"","date":"2026-11-28","externalUrl":null,"permalink":"/authors/%E4%B8%9C%E7%80%9B%E5%85%B5%E4%BA%BA/","section":"Authors","summary":"","title":"东瀛兵人","type":"authors"},{"content":"","date"